[Stage: build] WebPortal: npm install
[Stage: build] PaymentGateway: mvn compile
[Stage: test] FraudService: mvn test
[Stage: test] CreditRiskEngine: python3 -m unittest
[Stage: deploy] WebPortal -> web-tier
[Stage: deploy] PaymentGateway -> card-api
[Stage: deploy] FraudService -> fraud-tier
